# ---- Keep These (tracked files) ----
# README.md
# CHANGELOG.md
# LICENSE
# TRADEMARK.md
# MANIFEST.in
# setup.py
# requirements.txt
# pyrightconfig.json
# hvpdb_definitive_reference.md   <-- Main documentation
